have to be able to do if you  really want to be able to tell a parent  or a patient this is the course for you  disease and here's how we can change it  and these are two things that we and  many other folks in this field are now  starting to turn their attention to so  hopefully that was a good summary for  some of the things that we've been  working on um within the undiagnosed  disease Network and with that I would  just like to say thanks this is a lots  of names obviously this is a lot of work  and there are many different individuals  who contributed and collaborated not  least of all the patients and the  physicians who were part of the  undiagnosed disease Network and with  that I will say thank you and I will let  you know that if you do have any  questions that you can submit them and  they will come through to my email and  I've been only too happy to answer them  for you  thank you
 

